{"n":8,"title":"The moment it went wrong","blurb":"Past Continuous and Past Simple — while and when","steps":[{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"angry","pos":"adj","ru":"злой, рассерженный","kk":"ашулы","def":"feeling very annoyed, so that you want to shout at someone","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-angry.webp"},{"en":"anxious","pos":"adj","ru":"тревожный","kk":"уайымды","def":"worried about something that may happen","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-anxious.webp"},{"en":"confused","pos":"adj","ru":"растерянный, сбитый с толку","kk":"сасқан","def":"not able to understand what is happening","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-confused.webp"},{"en":"embarrassed","pos":"adj","ru":"смущённый","kk":"ұялған","def":"uncomfortable because other people have seen you do something silly","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-embarrassed.webp"},{"en":"excited","pos":"adj","ru":"радостно взволнованный","kk":"қуанышты толқыған","def":"very happy and full of energy about something that is going to happen","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-excited.webp"},{"en":"exhausted","pos":"adj","ru":"обессиленный","kk":"қалжыраған","def":"extremely tired, with no energy left at all","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-exhausted.webp"},{"en":"frightened","pos":"adj","ru":"испуганный","kk":"қорыққан","def":"afraid, because you think something bad may happen","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-frightened.webp"},{"en":"guilty","pos":"adj","ru":"виноватый","kk":"кінәлі","def":"unhappy because you know you have done something wrong","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-guilty.webp"},{"en":"nervous","pos":"adj","ru":"нервничающий","kk":"қобалжыған","def":"worried and a little afraid before something important","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-nervous.webp"},{"en":"pleased","pos":"adj","ru":"довольный","kk":"риза","def":"happy and satisfied with something","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-pleased.webp"},{"en":"stressed","pos":"adj","ru":"в стрессе, перегруженный","kk":"күйзелген","def":"worried and tense because you have too much to deal with","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-stressed.webp"},{"en":"in a good mood","pos":"phr","ru":"в хорошем настроении","kk":"көңіл күйі жақсы","def":"feeling happy and friendly at that moment","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-in-a-good-mood.webp"},{"en":"behaviour","pos":"n","ru":"поведение","kk":"мінез-құлық","def":"the way a person acts","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-behaviour.webp"},{"en":"eye contact","pos":"n","ru":"зрительный контакт","kk":"көзбен байланыс","def":"looking directly into another person’s eyes","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-eye-contact.webp"},{"en":"intercom","pos":"n","ru":"переговорное устройство","kk":"іштей байланыс құрылғысы","def":"a device that lets you speak to someone in another room or in a lift","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-intercom.webp"},{"en":"headphones","pos":"n","ru":"наушники","kk":"құлаққап","def":"equipment you wear over your ears so only you can hear the sound","img":"/course/a2/img/l8-headphones.webp"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"angry","options":["злой, рассерженный","тревожный","растерянный, сбитый с толку","смущённый"],"answer":"злой, рассерженный"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"anxious","options":["тревожный","радостно взволнованный","обессиленный","испуганный"],"answer":"тревожный"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"confused","options":["растерянный, сбитый с толку","виноватый","нервничающий","довольный"],"answer":"растерянный, сбитый с толку"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"embarrassed","options":["смущённый","в стрессе, перегруженный","в хорошем настроении","поведение"],"answer":"смущённый"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"excited","options":["радостно взволнованный","зрительный контакт","переговорное устройство","наушники"],"answer":"радостно взволнованный"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"exhausted","options":["обессиленный","злой, рассерженный","тревожный","растерянный, сбитый с толку"],"answer":"обессиленный"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Как это работает","html":"<span class=\"hl\">Was</span> it <span class=\"hl\">raining</span> when you <span class=\"hl\">went</span> out this morning?"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Как это работает","html":"What <span class=\"hl\">were</span> the other students <span class=\"hl\">doing</span> when you <span class=\"hl\">came</span> to class today?"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Как это работает","html":"What <span class=\"hl\">was happening</span> when you <span class=\"hl\">got</span> home yesterday?"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"choice","title":"Which action started first?","prompt":"—","options":["reading — it was already happening","the lift stopping","they started at the same moment"],"answer":"reading — it was already happening"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"was or were ?","prompt":"I ____ standing near the door.","options":["was","were","neither of these"],"answer":"was"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"was or were ?","prompt":"They ____ looking at their phones.","options":["was","were","neither of these"],"answer":"were"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"was or were ?","prompt":"____ it raining when you went out?","options":["Was","Were","neither of these"],"answer":"Was"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"was or were ?","prompt":"____ the other students working?","options":["Was","Were","neither of these"],"answer":"Were"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"rows","title":"Listen to Part 1. How many people, and what shape?","sub":"","track":"Track_3.7.mp3","items":[{"q":"Two people stand ____ .","options":["in opposite corners","side by side","near the door"],"answer":"in opposite corners"},{"q":"Three people make a ____ .","options":["triangle","square","line"],"answer":"triangle"}]},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Choose a card and write what happened.","sub":"Напиши ответ, затем проверь себя","placeholder":"Твой ответ…","model":"what you were doing"},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Отметь, чему научился","sub":"Я могу…","items":["✓ describe an action that was already happening — I was waiting for the lift","✓ say what cut into it — …when the lights went out","✓ use while with the long action and when with the short one","✓ make Past Continuous negatives, questions and short answers — Were you waiting? — Yes, I was.","✓ spell the -ing form — sitting, making, lying","✓ describe how someone felt — anxious, embarrassed, exhausted, guilty, pleased"]}]}